e exercised input.\\n\\nEffect on the run's picture. C10 now stands as a two-scenario obligation — the value truncation itself and the framing failure it inflicts on the following command — with its importance bounded by the configured command size but its mechanism fully recorded. Audit spec version 13; the nine earlier settled claims (C1/C6/C7/C9 confirmed violations, C2/C3/C4 confirmed, C5/C8 bounded protections) and the two paused candidates are untouched, with the scope-issue bookkeeping on the superseded C1 artifact the only visible administrative item. No requirement, premise or earlier observation was weakened.\"}"}}
